-- Repeatable (R__). Bronze views dbt reads as sources (ADR 0004): every RAW_* row plus two flags; the stg_
-- models drop flagged rows, so silver has no technical duplicates.
--   _IS_TECH_DUP: same topic, partition, offset and ce_id as an earlier row (the same message loaded twice).
--   _IS_RESEND:   same topic and ce_id as a message first seen at another partition/offset (producer retry).
